NAME
     chattr - change a file's attributes

SYNOPSIS
     chattr [-R] [+-=ATCDSacdeijstu] FILE...
     lsattr [-R] [FILE...]

DESCRIPTION
     chattr sets the ext4 inode flags: i makes a file immutable, a
     append-only, and so on. Called as lsattr it prints them.

OPTIONS
     -R   descend into directories
     +X   add the attribute, -X remove it, =X set exactly these

SEE ALSO
     ls(1), stat(1)
